COMMENT ON FUNCTION "public"."multideck_dexter_list_conversations_page"("p_query" "text", "p_limit" integer, "p_offset" integer) IS 'Returns an exact owner-private Dexter conversation page with bounded title and message search. This changes existing read transport only and adds no new write or Watching capability.';



